sequenceDiagram
    title BLE GATT Operation Concurrency

    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]

    Note over App, Node: Only one acknowledged operation may be in flight at a time.<br>Concurrent WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse and IndicationDone<br>calls are allowed alongside an in-flight acknowledged operation<br>(but not alongside another WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse).

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: Sequential acknowledged operations
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(<br>handle=0x0025, data=0x01)
        Note right of App: Wait for OperationComplete before the next call.
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

        App->>Node: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0025, data=0x64})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse alongside an acknowledged write
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse(<br>handle=0x0027, data=0x11)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponseComplete(success)

        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(<br>handle=0x0025, data=0x33)
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse(<br>handle=0x0027, data=0x22)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponseComplete(success)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
        Note over App, Node: Callbacks for the two calls may interleave.<br>Each callback matches its own request.
    end
